<title>UK: Abacus Polar up on weekend press report.</title>
<headline>Abacus Polar up on weekend press report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in UK electronics component distributor Abacus Polar climbed to an eight-month high on Monday after a favourable press report over the weekend, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 0939 GMT, the shares were up 12p to 216p.  </p>
<p>The Times said sellers of the shares may have overlooked Abacus's recovery potential and tipped the stock as a buy at 205p.</p>
<p>The shares have been under pressure in recent months after the company lost a series of franchises.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
</text>
